Q:You are given an array of size N. Find the sum of the results of bitwise OR of all the subarrays.The first line of input contains T - the number of test cases. It is followed by 2T lines, the first line contains N - the size of the array. The second line contains the elements of the array.
t=int(input())
for _ in range(t):
    n=int(input())
    l=list(map(int,input().split()))
    res=[]
    mxval=max(l)
    mxbt=mxval.bit_length()
    tot=(n*(n+1))//2
    for i in range(mxbt):
        c=0
        subarr=0
        for j in l:
            if (j>>i)1==0:
                c+=1
            else:
                subarr+=(c*(c+1))//2
                c=0
        subarr+=(c*(c+1))//2
        res.append(tot-subarr)
    s=0
    for i in range(mxbt):
        s+=res[i]*(1<<i)
    print(s)
